    "about": {
        "heading": "About Hayley",
        "homeSummary": "Hi, I'm Hayley Kharsa — a professional wig maker, wig dresser, and hairdresser with over 10 years of West End theatre experience. I've crafted and styled wigs for major productions and private clients alike.",
        "body": "<p>Hi, my name is Hayley Kharsa. I am a professional wig maker with over 10 years of theatre experience. I have created wigs and hair looks for productions ranging from <em>Wicked<\/em> to <em>Half a Sixpence<\/em>.<\/p>\r\n<p>My career spans the West End, national tours, and private client work. I specialise in period and contemporary wig construction, on-show wig maintenance, and bespoke hairdressing for weddings and events.<\/p>\r\n<p>Whether you need a full hand-knotted wig built from scratch, continuity care for a long-running show, or a stunning bridal look, I bring the same level of precision and creativity to every job.<\/p>\r\n<p>I am available for freelance theatre engagements, private bookings, and consultations. Please get in touch to discuss your requirements.<\/p>",
